window.products.push({"id":917136,"name":"Elechomes Air Purifier for Home Large Room with Air Quality Monitoring: H13 True HEPA Air Filter Cleaner Covers 400ft² & CADR 300+, Ideal for Allergen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+aOFb-DzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade 4-Stage Fil-tration System: P300 air purifier combines ultra-fine pre-fil-ter, ATP fil-ter, H13 HEPA fil-ter, and activated carbon fil-ter, which can capture 99.97% of particles as small as 0.3 microns. Ideal air purifiers for hair, pet dander, smoke, pollen, etc. Excellent Choice for Large Room: Elechomes P300 air cleaner is designed to accommodate rooms up to 400 sq. ft. CADR rate up to 307 m³/h, can easily cover a room up to 100 sq. ft faster in 15 minutes. 100% ozone-free, more reliable to use. 360° air circulation covers the space in all directions. Low Energy Consumption & Ultra Quiet Sleep Mode: The rated power is only 40W, allowing the air filter to run at low energy consumption throughout the day, saving more money; Only 22dB in sleep mode, fil-tering the air with the lowest noise level; and with lamp control, easy to create a quiet environment to help you fall asleep deeply. Smart Air Quality Sensor: In auto mode, the sensor will detect the air quality level in real-time, and will automatically adjust the wind speed from 1 to 3. The LED indicator and large display allow you to track the cleanliness of the indoor air every minute of every day, allowing all your family members to breathe fresh air. Innovative & Intimate Design: Innovative and repeatable use pre-fil-ter, only need to tear off the tape for a more thorough cleaning, effectively extending the service life of the filter; built-in hidden handle makes it easier to move. Search P300 replaceable filters and continue to enjoy cleaner air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+aOFb-DzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elechomes","source_asin":"B08FD4MR1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FD4MR1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FD4MR1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":917137,"name":"UPMSX Smart Wireless Meat Thermometer, Bluetooth Food Digital Thermometer with 165ft Wireless Range, Cooking Thermometer with Ultra-Thin Probe for BBQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GGMShLduL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTRA-WIDE WIRELESS RANGE: No wires, no hassle. Connected via the advanced Bluetooth 5.2, the built-in bluetooth repeater in the charger of meat thermometer digital extends the wireless range up to 165 feet, freeing you from hovering over the hot grill, or stove. You can get updates on the real-time temperature of the meat on phone or tablet PC while you are inside sitting back to watch games or entertain your guest. BRING THE FIVE-STAR RESTAURANT HOME: Takes the guessing work out of grilling at all. The food cooking thermometer adopts advanced sensor offering quick, accurate and real-time readout technology, monitoring internal meat temperature with a temperature accuracy of +/-1.8° F. Make overcooked or undercooked meats a thing of the past. POWERED BY THE PROBE TEMP APP: Preset the target temperature based on the USDA-recommended temperature for eleven kinds of meat or customize temp target to elevate your cooking like a Pro. The PROBE TEMP APP of digital meat thermometer for cooking will send sound and vibration alerts when the food is ready, ensuring every piece of meat comes out precisely and perfectly every time. KEEP JUICY FLAVOR: The sharp meat thermometer wireless design lets you slide it into meat easily. With an ultra-thin probe diameter of only 0.21 inches, the ultra-thin food thermometer digital makes your food intact and juicy through and through. EXPLORE THE CULINARY ART: Our smart thermometer can be used in oven, stove, smoker, grill, air fryer, rotisserie, sous vide, and more. Takes your cooking game to a whoel new level! Remember do not use it in microwave oven or pressure cooker. RECHARGEABLE & WATERPROOF: The meat thermometer can run for 4-6 hours on a quick full charge of 5 minutes. Made with premium 304 stainless steel and heat-resistance plastic, wireless bluetooth meat thermometer features rustproof and IP67-rated waterproof that is easy to clean. Notice that does not rinse the bamboo charger with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GGMShLduL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UPMSX","source_asin":"B0C8BHZ6YZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8BHZ6YZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8BHZ6YZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
