window.products.push({"id":917173,"name":"POMORON MJ003H Air Purifiers for Home Large Room Up To 620ft², H13 True HEPA Air Purifier Air Filter Remove 99.97% Dust Pollen Smoke Odors Allergies A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W2foiZMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Area Coverage: Designed with 360° air intake and equipped with powerful brushless motor, our air purifier has the ability to refresh the air for a 620ft² room in 30 minutes or refresh the air 5x/hrs in rooms as large as 248ft² in max speed mode. Just turn on our air purifier and enjoy fresh air in minutes. Powerful Purification: The HEPA air purifier is equipped with 4 layer H13 HEPA filtering system which can effectively filter 99.97% of airborne particles larger than 0.3 microns, such as Pollen, Dust, Pet Dander and Smoke. Activated carbon effectively absorbs smoke, vocs and smell from the air. Unique Detachable Body Design: It is a fact that dust tends to accumulate in the air inlet shell, it's a potential health problem for every family using air purifiers. For the first time, the air purifier has a detachable body. It allows you to unscrew the air intake part of the air purifier and wash it thoroughly under running water. 4 Level Fan Speed & 5 Timer Options: By adjusting the fan speed, you can control the speed of purification according to different situation, including a ultra quiet-sleep mode for night or high efficiency for a heavy smoker. Designed with 5/8/12/24 hrs timer which is good for energy saving for the whole family. Official POMORON Filters: Search for MJ003H-RF to find POMORON's MJ003H replacement filter. Please use only POMORON filters, off-brand filters are not guaranteed to offer the same performance or quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W2foiZMFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POMORON","source_asin":"B09MHQ9ZCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MHQ9ZCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MHQ9ZCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
