window.products.push({"id":917294,"name":"ORIA Digital Coffee Scale with Timer, Rechargeable Espresso Scale, 3kg/0.1g Mini Coffee Scale Drip Espresso Scale, Food Scale with 3 Units, Tare Funct","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qqmiDgeML._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Accuracy & Wide Range】Built -in 4 high -precision weighing sensors, accuracy of 0.1g, with a weight capacity from 1-3000g, the digital coffee scale always helps you measure and get an exceptional cup of coffee with refined accuracy. 【Multi -functional Coffee/Food Scale with Timer】The timer can be accurate to 1s, and the timing time is 99 minutes and 59 seconds. You can easily control the brewing time. When you do not need the timing function, you can use it as a kitchen scale. It is also perfect for for cooking, baking, making cocktail, etc. 【Unit Conversion & Touch Buttons】The precision drip espresso scale supports switching of different units of oz/ml/g, which can weigh solids, liquids, powders. The high sensitivity touch buttons is elegant and convenient operation, makes weighing faster and easier. 【LED Display & Type-C Charging】The pour-over coffee scale with time adopts the high -definition LED screen, it can be easily read even in a dim or dazzling environment. With Type-C charging cable, it takes about 2-3 hours to full charge and can be used for about 3 months (It is related to the frequency of use). 【Auto-off & Intelligent Indicator】With automatic shutdown function(Auto-off without operating by default 60 s), low battery indicator and overload indicator. This can help extend the service life of the product, but also facilitate you to replace the battery in time and use it correctly. 【Heartwarming Reminder】The compact coffee scale can be easily placed in the kitchen drawer or carried when camping outdoors. If there are any problems with the use or function of the product, or if the product is defective/damaged, please contact the seller first, we will do our best to solve the problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qqmiDgeML._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIA","source_asin":"B0C7FPN512","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7FPN512","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7FPN512","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
