window.products.push({"id":917306,"name":"THE PERFECT PIE Premium Pizza Peel 12\" x 14\" Aluminum Pizza Paddle with Foldable Handle for Storage and 14” Rocker Cutter with Protective Cover. Gourm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c7P1UYIDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Pie Aluminum Pizza Peel Paddle and Stainless Steel Rocker Cutter Set is the ultimate pizza accessory tool and supplies kit sure to please every pizza enthusiast. The commercial grade aluminum is extremely durable and capable of withstanding extremely high temperatures. The sleek pizza peel paddle is thin yet sturdy enough to easily slide under whatever it is you are creating, unlike wooden peels which are often too thick to do the job. The high-quality stainless steel rocker cutter is 100% dishwasher safe and comes with protective blade cover with safety in mind. The Perfect Pie Pizza Peel Paddle and Rocker Cutter Set is a great gift idea for the chef in your life and a perfect match for any kitchen décor, gourmet pizza parlor or bakery. Comes in custom designed box. The stylish and custom design of this set is sure to impress all your guests. Instructions For Use 1.Turn the knob to loosen the screw and turn handle 180°. Firmly tighten the handle.  2.Sprinkle flour to allow the pizza, bread or baked goods to slide easily onto the peel.  3.Carefully place food onto a pizza stone, baking sheet or tray with the peel.  4.Once finished cooking, slide out the pizza, bread or baked goods from the oven using the pizza peel paddle.  5.Slice with precision using the rocker cutter.  6.Serve and enjoy your creation!! Care Instructions ✅Hand wash pizza peel paddle in warm, soapy water. Scrape off any excess food or crumbs from the peel using a soft sponge. Dry immediately.  ✅Do not soak or use abrasive scrubbers on the pizza peel. Not dishwasher safe.  ✅Do not slice pizza or baked goods on the peel. It may damage knife or scratch peel.  ✅Do not leave the pizza peel in the oven for a long time. This will damage handle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c7P1UYIDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE PERFECT PIE YOUR HOME FOR QUALITY PIZZA ACCESSORIES","source_asin":"B088LMHTG2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LMHTG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LMHTG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
