window.products.push({"id":917311,"name":"Tovolo Flow Pen 2.0 With Removable Cap 3-Cup Capacity Dispenser, Easy-Squeeze Batter Bottle With Mess-Free Valve for Pancake Art, Cayenne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tui1+5XwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make breakfast even more fun with this Pancake Pen 2.0 from Tovolo! Easily create fun shapes or perfectly round flapjacks without messes or spills. Add your preferred pancake mix, add wet ingredients, and shake to combine! Pen holds up to 3 cups of batter, so you can mix up enough batter to feed a crowd! If shaking to combine, leave room in the pen for ingredients to mix for best results. Whether you design a character, scribble a note, or doodle something unique, you’ll create memorable pancakes every time. The contoured batter dispenser is comfortable to hold and easy to squeeze, and the mess-free valve prevents drips until you’re ready to pour. Now with a convenient lid for even easier storage! The lid snaps on over the drip-free nozzle, allowing you to store the pen upside down for pancake doodles later. The slender bottle slides into refrigerator doors or between leftover containers, so you can save your extra batter for an extra-special breakfast tomorrow. The evenly balanced lid also acts and a stand for the pen between batches. Designed with simplicity in mind, the entire Pancake Pen is dishwasher-safe! Simply dissemble, then place the components in the dishwasher for quick breakfast cleanup. The drip-proof design also prevents drips, spills, and splatters, preventing additional cleanup. Made of nylon and easy-squeeze silicone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tui1+5XwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B088V4YZ98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088V4YZ98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088V4YZ98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
