window.products.push({"id":917321,"name":"BOHO GARDEN Farmhouse Wood Bead Garland with Big 0.4-0.8” Beads - 56” Long Farmhouse Decor Accent with 4\" Tassels - Beaded Boho Room Decor for Country","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O-vC-SypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for unique bohemian ornaments for your home? A single piece of furniture or decor can elevate your home’s aesthetic. Even small, seemingly simple accents can bring out the best in any space. Simple yet stylish decor–often minimalist or rustic-themed–are naturally excellent in complementing any living space. Chic, wood-made items like our wood bead garlands are a safe choice when choosing decor to liven up dull spaces or enhance your room’s aesthetic. Our BOHO GARDEN Wood Bead Garlands are versatile, boho-style decor that will look stunning anywhere they're displayed. Treat your rooms to a stylish upgrade by adding a modest yet classy piece like our wood bead garlands. Crafted from elegant, natural wood and accented with 4\" jute tassels, our wooden bead decor adds character and depth to your living room, bedroom, or kitchen. With varying diameters and lengths, our wood bead decors are highly versatile. You can use the shorter 0.63-inch beads to accent an exquisite bowl or as an addition to your decorative tray. As for the longer ones, they’re best draped over tables or books, hung on the wall or window, or coiled on a wreath or holiday tree. Since the garlands come unstained, the beads can be dyed, varnished, or painted to your liking. These upscale wood bead decorations are great for homes and rustic-styled restaurants and cafes. They're also excellent to give as a thoughtful present to family and friends. More reasons to love our wooden garland: - Available in various bead sizes and lengths - No sharp burrs or splinters - Long lasting, natural materials Invite natural warmth and stylish charm into your home. Add the BOHO GARDEN Farmhouse Garland to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O-vC-SypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOHO GARDEN","source_asin":"B0BNQHY5XL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQHY5XL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQHY5XL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
