window.products.push({"id":917410,"name":"Set of 4 PREMIUM Bicycle Coasters - 3.5\" Wood Coasters High Gloss Finish Bike","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h9nZsM-AL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of four hand made coasters featuring hand drawn bicycle sketches. An awesome bit of home decor for any biker or bike enthusiast, this bicycle themed barware makes for a great Birthday or Valentine's Day gift. These bar coasters are entirely, custom, handmade for you.   Every single set is hand sanded, painted, and given a thick coat of high build glossy epoxy. I only use the highest quality paints and epoxies, and every set will last for years of use.   I happily make custom coasters featuring your own art or modify this for you. I will offer discounts on multiple sets, just ask.   What makes my premium coasters so special? Every coaster is made from deeply engraved 1/4” birch wood. Wood stain brings out the grain of the wood, and then the coaster is coated in a thick layer of epoxy. The epoxy dries crystal clear and smooth as glass, and the depth of the engraving really pops out! The epoxy coat will protect your coaster like nothing else. The grain and wood pattern reflect light beautifully.   The coasters feature cork backing to protect your table from scratching and damage. I stand behind my work and will do everything possible to make sure you are satisfied with your purchase.   Wholesale and non-profit rates available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h9nZsM-AL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"1337 Shady Studios","source_asin":"B0795BF4RT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0795BF4RT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0795BF4RT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
