window.products.push({"id":917459,"name":"Pittman Outdoors Extreme Series Indoor and Outdoor Waterproof Air Mattress with Built-in Electrical Air Pump, Queen 20-inches Tall, Realtree Camo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":152.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lao8X6psL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Pitman Outdoors Etreme premium air mattresses are the perfect mattress for camping and home use. The heavy duty fabric is 48% more puncture resistant, 28% stronger, and 30% lighter than our standard air mattresses. Heavy Duty Fabric Construction. Inflates to 78\"x60\"x16\" which is ideal for queen size sheets. The comfort coil system distributes air throughout the mattress to support the full length of your body. The bottom Stabilizer Chamber increases the stabilization and support of the mattress. Oversized carry bag and patch kit included.Pittman Queen 20-inch Extreme Fabric queen air mattress is just what you need for Indoor/Outdoors events. Specially for outdoor/indoor camping The built-in electrical air pump allows you to inflate and deflate the mattress quickly then discreetly pack the cord into the integrated storage compartment. The indentations along the side and flocked top keep fitted sheets in place. High-Power, Built-in Electric Air Pump With Inflate/Deflate Features The built-in electrical pump makes inflation and deflation simple. At full power, the airbed inflates in under 4 minutes. The pump plugs into any standard 110-120V home outlet and can be turned on with just the touch of a button for maximum convenience. However, if you want to use the bed for travel, a separate DC pump (PPI-AC3 sold separately)can also be used to inflate the bed; simply insert the nozzle of your separate pump into the center of the inflation dial while it is set to inflate, and begin inflating. Super Convenient Carry Bag A carry bag is included to make travel and storage easy. Pittman Queen Airbed Mattress folds compactly after use to fit nicely into the stylish bag. Easy-Fit Queen Size The Pittman Queen Airbed Mattress is the size of a traditional queen sized bed, so fitted sheets work great and you can use the bedspread you already own. Additionally, the bed is raised 20 inches from the ground, making it easy to get in and out of. Incredibly Soft, Flocked Top The soft, flocked top makes for a comfy sleeping surface, ensuring a cozy outdoors nights sleep, every night. Its made of durable vinyl so its waterproof, making it suitable for camping. Finally, the new horizontal beam construction provides a more consistent and sturdy sleeping surface. Built-in Electric AC air Pump Included. Great For Indoor/Outdoor use Heavy Duty laminated Fabric Blend Construction Premium Fabric Construction for a Superior nights sleep Carry Bag & Patch Kit With Glue Included Weight Capacity: 1000 Pounds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lao8X6psL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pittman Outdoors","source_asin":"B07D4Y3WZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D4Y3WZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D4Y3WZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
