window.products.push({"id":917483,"name":"ArtStudy Happy Easter Bunny Throw Pillow Covers 18x18 Inch, Set of 4 Cotton Linen Farmhouse Birds Nest Spring Seasonal Cushion Cover, Wreath Colorful ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gSvtEwyzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Happy Easter Spring Throw Pillow Covers 18x18 Inch Double-Sided Design, ArtStudy Set of 4 Cotton Linen Easter Bunny Truck Cushion Pillowcases for Spring Home Decor. Wanna keep the unique Easter's Day in mind? Wanna bring a tinge color into your home on Easter's Day? 1.This is a must-have for a family holiday and can help you quickly change the decorations. The unique Easter's Day pattern pillowcases are an easy way to update your Easter Day decorations. 2.The 18x18 inch easter bunny eggs pillow covers are perfect gifts for Easter's Day and great decorations for your bedroom, living room, dining room, study room, bed, couch, sofa, chair... 3.Update your home decor with these attractive 18x18 inch square spring pillow covers for Happy Easter Day! Description: - Dimension: 18\"x 18\", suitable for 16x16, 18x18, 20x20 inch pillows. Pls allow 1~2cm deviation because of hand-cutting and sewing. - Weight 320g/0.71 lbs for 4 pack - The closure is a zipper closure on the bottom seam so that you don't have to worry about which side is facing forward. The zipper closure also allows the pillow to poof better compared to an envelope closure. - Same fabric on both sides - No dyes harming the health of your family. - All inside edges are serged stitched to prevent fraying. - This fabric is rated for outdoor use, soft to the touch, and is perfect for indoor or outdoor home decor. It is stain and fade resistant up to 500 UV hours. Tips to Stuff your Insert: Step1. Get the core ready, open the bunny pillow case on the zipper side, fold the core and put it inside the pillow case to the bottom. Step2. Let go of your hand, make sure that your core has stuffed the corners of the pillowcase, then close the zipper slowly to make sure it doest not split. Step3. Slightly flap on your pillow to make sure the core will sit well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gSvtEwyzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtStudy","source_asin":"B08R59F7BP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R59F7BP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R59F7BP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
