window.products.push({"id":917517,"name":"Vickes Coffee Mug Warmer, Smart Coffee Warmer for Desk Auto Shut Off Tea Cup Warmer with 3 Temperature Setting, Beverage Warmer Heating Pad for Cocoa ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511sjt-dXyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Use】This mug warmer for desk has three levels of adjustable heating (104℉/40℃ or 122℉/50℃ or 131℉/55℃) and intelligent constant temperature function. Just plug the adapter into the socket, place a cup on the plate, and then press the touch switch gently to adjust the heating temperature. Put it on your desk and you can focus on what you are doing, and the heater will prepare warm beverages (coffee, milk, tea, etc) for you, allowing you to enjoy delicious drinks at any time. 【High Applicability】The heating plate has no grooves, so it can adapt to most thin-walled, flat or slightly recessed cups, such as metal, ceramic, enamel, stainless steel, feeding bottles (high temperature resistant plastic), milk cartons, glass cups and so on. Tip: Use a cup with cover, thin wall, and flat bottom to get the best heat preservation performance. Covering the lid will also help retain heat, And it is only applied for heating and keeping warm, but it does not boil liquids. 【Automatic Shut-off】Our cup warmer for desk will turn off automatically after 12 hours of continuous operation. When you are so busy and forget to turn off the cup warmer, you no longer need to worry about safety issues, it makes you more worry-free. Note: After manually turning off the coffee heater, the heating plate is still hot, so do not touch the heating plate. 【Waterproof Design】Its warming plate adopts sealed-insulation technology and has passed the patented waterproof certification (FCC & UL certification). The smooth and shiny glass layer on the top makes it easy to clean. If you are clumsy occasionally, the beverage heater will be your best choice, just use a towel to clean the stains on the glass panel. In addition, flame-retardant materials and low-power heating design ensure that the heater will not be short-circuited, which is safer for you. 【Warm Gift Choice】The coffee cup warmer for desk auto shut off is exquisite and compact: 5 x 5.2 x 0.7in / 12.8 x 13.2 x 2cm. The heater keeps the drink warm throughout the day. It is an excellent gift for your lover, father, mother, wife, husband and all relatives on special occasions such as Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving and Christmas. Let this cup heater warm their stomach and heart to express your concern. Feel free to contact me by e-mail if you need instructions in French. Thanks for understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511sjt-dXyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vickes","source_asin":"B09JK7GDWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JK7GDWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JK7GDWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
