window.products.push({"id":917599,"name":"Bartender Kit - at Home Mixology Bar Kit, Bartender Set w/Jigger for Bartending, 25oz Martini Cocktail Shaker, Strainer, Mixer Spoon, Pourers, Muddler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CFPKNAe6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Imported 🍸 COMPLETE COCKTAIL SHAKER SET: Now you can make it happy hour anytime you want! This bartending kitincludes a complete set of 12 stainless steel bar tools in a compact wooden bamboo stand ready for display. Bar set cocktail shaker set includes: 25oz/750ml Cocktail Shaker, Ice Tongs, Corkscrew Opener, Double-Sided Measuring Jigger, Strainer, Cocktail Muddler, Mixing Spoon 🍹 SERVE CRAFT-STYLE DRINKS & COCKTAILS AT HOME: Perfect for the budding mixologist, this set is made from 304 Food Grade Stainless Steel and has everything needed to mix all your favorite cocktails and drinks for your family and your friends right at home. This set of high-quality bar tender's kit will mix delicious drinks and complete your bar carts look for all to envy ✨ INCLUDES RECIPES & WHISKEY STONES: This set is everything you expect and more! With this bartender set their will be something for everyone who pulls up a seat at your bar. Unlike others we added a set of 4 extra whiskey stones for those who prefer their drinks neat and not watered down and a set of drink recipe cards that are easy to follow and learn how to mix new drinks. Plus, a Fun Special Bonus! 🍷PREMIUM MUDDLER FOR COCKTAILS: 🍹 This bar shaker set is everything you expect and more! The premium Muddler will bring out all the freshness of the herbs for everyone who pulls up a seat at your bar. The ETCBUYS Bartender Kit combines function with design so that you can mix up your favorite drinks as well as elegantly display this set on any bar or bar cart to accent your home decor 🍸 Mini Cocktail Shaker: Modern Mixology Cocktail Shaker Set perfect for beginners. This Wine Making Kit for beginners includes a wine shaker cocktail that makes it easy to create delicious drinks at home. Impress your guests with your bartending skills with this sleek and elegant cocktail shaker set, perfect for any occasion. 🍹 Complete Bartending Kit: Includes everything you need to set up a professional home bar. Perfect for the mixology enthusiast or professional bartender, this cocktail kit has all the essential tools for creating delicious drinks. 💝GREAT HOLIDAY GIFT IDEA: Beautifully packaged for gift-giving, this bar tools bartender tool kit will be sure to make any beginner or experienced bartender happy this holiday season. The bar tool set has all the essential pieces needed and the neutral colors are perfect to give as a housewarming gift that will match any decor 🍷","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CFPKNAe6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOME OF SPOILS","source_asin":"B096YHQPHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096YHQPHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096YHQPHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
