window.products.push({"id":917623,"name":"Lilac and Gooseberry Scented Large Soy Candle Tin | 14 ounces Hand Poured | Clean Burning Soy Wax | Yennefer Scent of a Sorceress by Bella Des Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7130nWs6gvL._SL1274_.jpg","description":"FOR ENCHANTING SPELLS AND ROMANTIC RITUALS Conjure romance or enchant your lover with the dancing flame of candlelight. This large, double wick, highly scented candle will transform an ordinary room into a sorceress's chamber infused with the mystical, alluring scent of Lilac and Gooseberry. UNLEASH YOUR INNER SORCERESS Lilac & Gooseberries is the signature scent of the legendary sorceress, Yennefer of Vengerberg. Our Lilac and Gooseberry scent will envelop you in the essence of a mighty sorceress. The mystical marriage of delicate spring lilac with lively gooseberries evokes the magical renewal of life in springtime. Tap into the power of rebirth and conjure the forces of nature to unleash your own inner sorceress. SMELLS GREAT, BURNS CLEAN, AND LASTS A LONG TIME Made from clean burning, sustainable, eco-friendly soy wax. Covered tin holds scent in candle when not burning. Candles have two self-trimming wicks. This 14 ounce candle burns approximately 40 hours. Vegan friendly. YOU CAN TAKE IT WITH YOU! Toss this candle tin in your suitcase for your next trip or vacation. It may come in handy for a romantic ritual or to enlighten your mood. This candle’s durable metal and re-closable lid make it worry free and ideal for travel. SMOKE AND HASSLE FREE When you have finished enjoying your candle, simply replace the lid to prevent the release of smoke. Our wicks are self-trimming, so you never need to bother with them. HANDMADE IN AMERICA This candle was hand poured in Ann Arbor, Michigan, USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7130nWs6gvL._SL1274_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BELLA DES NATURAL BEAUTY","source_asin":"B07KDJ2MJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KDJ2MJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KDJ2MJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
