window.products.push({"id":917783,"name":"Vacplus Moisture Absorbers, Dehumidifiers for Closet, Refillable Moisture Absorbers for Rooms, basements, bathrooms, Boats, RVs, 7.76 OZ Humidity Abso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cwRWdhJIL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFICIENT DEHUMIDIFICATION: Each Vacplus dehumidifier for home includes 6 packs of 7.76-oz calcium chloride tablets for long-term use. They can effectively absorb excess moisture in the air and keep your room dry all the time. (Note: This product is refill tabs only, not including the moisture absorber bucket.) SEPATARE PACKAGE: Vacplus moisture remover tablets are individually wrapped in small plastic bags, enabling you to store them for a long time. Just replace it with a new pack when the tablet in the bucket runs out. ECONOMICALLY REUSABLE: With the reusable bucket, Vacplus economical moisture absorber refill tabs produce less waste than those single-used products. Vacplus always tries to lead a cost-effective and energy-effective life. EASY OPERATION: These safe moisture absorbers are super easy to use. Once the calcium chloride tablet is completely dissolved, you can just remove the exhausted moisture absorber tablet, empty the collection layer, and place a new refill tablet in before putting the mesh lid back on. EFFECTIVE DEODORIZATION: Vacplus moisture removers can not only help to remove the musty odors caused by moisture but also emit a delicate lavender fragrance to refresh the air. Just keep the space dry and comfortable all the time with Vacplus.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cwRWdhJIL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacplus","source_asin":"B09YCY55CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YCY55CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YCY55CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
