window.products.push({"id":917837,"name":"Nappy Cloud - Foam Neck Pillow - Firm Support. Patented Shape: Perfect for Travel, Home, Beds, and Desk.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EknjjrbRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Nappy Cloud is the most unique and versatile pillow because It helps you nap on: - Airplanes - Over Night Shifts - Desks - Car Rides - Your In-Laws' Dinner Party - Random Relative’s Graduation - Annoying Rom-Coms - And More In all seriousness, Nappy Cloud is a portable pillow that helps you sleep in awkward or uncomfortable places. It’s high-quality memory foam and cool fabric allows you to stay cozy and cool for longer. #GetNappyStayHappy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EknjjrbRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nappy Cloud","source_asin":"B07H7THYWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H7THYWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H7THYWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":917838,"name":"Portmeirion Sophie Conran White Small Salad Bowl | 9.5 Inch Serving Bowl for Salad, Pasta, and Fruit | Made from Fine Porcelain | Dishwasher and Micro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LvqADJbaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Sophie Conran Collection was designed exclusively for Portmeirion. This collection is as durable and functional as it is beautiful. Sophie is part of the world-famous Conran lifestyle and culinary dynasty. The simplistic and organic nature of this collection makes it perfect for every style and taste. Each beautifully delicate item meets the hard-wearing needs of today's family and culinary experts. Available in White, Bisque and Celadon, the look can be as simple or diverse as your tastes demand. Amazon.com This simple, beautiful, and functional salad bowl is part of an entire tableware and bakeware collection designed by Sophie Conran, an English food writer with her own gourmet pie company. Conran infuses her namesake tableware with a flowing organic nature and tactile expression, as evidenced by the ridges and dipped rims that recall handcrafted pottery. Made of porcelain expressly for Portmeirion, the collection comes in glossy white with select pieces available in cool blue celadon and a creamy biscuit color. The smaller of two serving bowls, this one takes the shape of a round bowl that's been gently pushed into a more oval shape while still in the moist clay stage. With its slightly wavy and uneven rim, giving it a rustic yet modern appeal, the 9-1/2-inch bowl compellingly serves up a crisp green salad, fresh fruit salad, and side dishes of rice or vegetables. The quite durable bowl is safe to use in the freezer, microwave, and oven, and goes right into the dishwasher for easy clean-up. Pair with the larger 13-inch bowl for coordinated serving at the table. Any Sophie Conran piece makes a great gift for the home cook who enjoys something out of the ordinary. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LvqADJbaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B079MDPYLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MDPYLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079MDPYLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
