window.products.push({"id":917949,"name":"Deconovo Blackout Curtain Room Darkening Thermal Insulated Draperies Grommet Window Treatments for Bedroom, 38 x 72 in, Red, 2 Panels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81okXqJd2pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you have bought Deconovo square printed thermal insulated blackout curtains, you get the of buying the best. They bring a comfortable and lively atmosphere in your home. Neutral background color gives fabric an incredible beauty. These durable curtains are stylish and have a unique design. The silver square dots print pattern adds a rich and modern expensive dressing look to your decor. Made of 100% premium polyester, our curtains are silky, soft, drapery and very pleasant touch when compared to the others. All seams are nice and straight with no loose threads. Square patterns have no visual defects. They are made to last for a long time! The grommet construction makes them super easy to hang. The triple weave technique that can block out most of sunlight. There is nothing better than a good night sleep to enable you to wake up refreshed and feeling perfectly alright. This is how our blackout curtains can help you. Features: Package includes 2 panels which measures 38 Inch wide and 72 Inch long (97cm x 183cm) per each. Our decorative blackout window drapes are perfect for: late sleepers, shift workers, seniors, infants, parents, kids, students, computer operators and more. They ensure that even if you are a light sleeper you will not be disturbed by the sound on the streets. They will stop the outside world from creeping into your private moments so you can enjoy the time with family members and friends. P. S. The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, variations in color between the actual product and your screen may occur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81okXqJd2pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deconovo","source_asin":"B0C4GHGZW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-917949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4GHGZW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4GHGZW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
